      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{4p+8}{4p-8}\\times\\frac{p-2}{p+2}&=\\frac{4(p+2)}{4(p-2)}\\times\\frac{p-2}{p+2}\\\\\\frac{4p+8}{4p-8}\\times\\frac{p-2}{p+2}&=1\\end{align*}$$\nOriginal domain: $p\\ne-2,2$.",
